
>> santaLaugh := ['ho'].
>> laugh := [''].
{ laugh := laugh + santaLaugh. } × 3.
Izvade rakstīt: laugh, jauna-rinda.

>> locked := Aplams.
>> security := Patiess.
security patiess: { locked := Patiess. }.
Izvade rakstīt: locked, jauna-rinda.

>> n := 7.
(Patiess) patiess: { n := 9. }.
Izvade rakstīt: n.
